From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*hwar||where}}. Cognate with {{etyl|ang|-}} {{term|hwær|lang=ang}}, {{etyl|ofs|-}} {{term|hwer|hwēr|lang=ofs}}, {{etyl|osx|-}} {{term|hwar|lang=osx}}, {{etyl|odt|-}} {{term|war|lang=odt}}, {{term|wara|lang=odt}}, {{etyl|goh|-}} {{term|war|lang=goh}}, {{etyl|got|-}} {{term|𐍈𐌰𐍂|tr=[[hwar#Gothic|hwar]]|lang=got|sc=Goth}}.

===Adverb===
{{non-adv|-}}
# [[where]]

