===Etymology 2===
From {{etyl|gem-pro|non}} {{term/t|gem-pro|*hwaz}}, whence also Old English {{term|hwa|lang=ang}} (English {{term|who|lang=en}}), Old High German {{term|hwer|lang=goh}} (German {{term|wer|lang=de}}), Gothic {{term|𐍈𐌰𐍃|tr=hwas|lang=got}}.

