'''*hvar''' (''nominative form uncertain as the word is abbreviated in manuscripts, dative'' '''[[hveim]]'''; ''neuter'' '''[[hvat#Old Norse|hvat]]''', ''dative'' '''[[hví#Old Norse|hví]]''', ''genitive'' '''[[hves]]''')

